{"id":"n83288-1-10","stage":4,"title":"고비 · 关头","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83288-1-10-1","ko":"이제 더위도 한 고비가 지났네요.","zh":"现在暑热也快要过去了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"더위도","meaning":"热，暑热","explanation":"더위：热，暑热；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"더위","audio":"/audio/34336435fffc87890da8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47399","senseId":"1","lemma":"더위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더위도","audio":"/audio/59e1eabdf6c90d99f771.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"限度","explanation":"한：限度","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84551","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"고비가","meaning":"关头，节骨眼","explanation":"고비：关头，节骨眼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고비","audio":"/audio/7c6f9f12f46ad8b73523.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83288","senseId":"1","lemma":"고비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고비가","audio":"/audio/65cb5788cc53ff2ac040.mp3"}},{"text":"지났네요.","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지났네요","audio":"/audio/0d053137b26134ca229b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"34336435fffc8789","term":"더위","zh":"热，暑热","audio":"/audio/34336435fffc87890da8.mp3","entryId":"47399","definition":"夏季的暑气；炎热的天气。","pronunciation":["더위"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"限度","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"84551","definition":"时间、空间、数量、程度等的极限。","pronunciation":["한ː"]},{"id":"7c6f9f12f46ad8b7","term":"고비","zh":"关头，节骨眼","audio":"/audio/7c6f9f12f46ad8b73523.mp3","entryId":"83288","definition":"事情完成的过程中最重要或最艰难的瞬间。","pronunciation":["고비"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f79a1e6fa9a4102386ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83288-1-10-2","ko":"네, 금방 아침저녁으로 쌀쌀해지겠군요.","zh":"是啊，很快早晚就会变得凉爽了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"아침저녁으로","meaning":"早晚，朝夕","explanation":"아침저녁：早晚，朝夕；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"아침저녁","audio":"/audio/152d068cd58c4898cefd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93384","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침저녁으로","audio":"/audio/b1372bba72460c0593ca.mp3"}},{"text":"쌀쌀해지겠군요.","meaning":"凉飕飕；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"쌀쌀하다：凉飕飕；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"쌀쌀하다","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0